<title>USA: PSE to list options on Carolina Power &amp; Light.</title>
<headline>PSE to list options on Carolina Power &amp; Light.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said Friday it would list options on Carolina Power &amp; Light Co on October 2.</p>
<p>The option will have strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 that will be available for expiration months of October, November, January and April. The stock ended at 34-3/4 on Friday.</p>
<p>The options will trade in the Schering-Plough Corp trading crowd, the exchange said.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
